{%- comment -%}
  MUTO — "Your life won't fit a perfect routine. Your body still needs one." (muto-bf-jobs). A dark band under the
  buy box and the reviews strip: the eyebrow "Not everybody is a 25-year-old PT.", the headline, one line in plain
  words, then four cards, one per reason people start MUTO (from the jobs-to-be-done
  research, Nov 2026): flat afternoons, training recovery, a life that won't fit a routine, too many pots.
  Product benefits use authorised claims only (B vitamins and folate: tiredness and fatigue; vitamin D: muscle
  function). Rendered by the custom-liquid section after the buy box (ag1_plans); it stays where it is.
  Above the band: an "As seen in" row with the Men's Fitness and Women's Fitness logos (as on the listicle).
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="mc-seen" aria-label="As seen in">
  <p class="mc-seen__lab">As seen in</p>
  <ul class="mc-seen__logos" role="list">
    <li><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/mens-fitness-magazine-logo-blue_1.jpg?v=1769537356&width=360" alt="Men's Fitness" width="180" height="48" loading="lazy"></li>
    <li><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/womens-fitness-magazine-logo-blue_1.jpg?v=1769537339&width=360" alt="Women's Fitness" width="180" height="48" loading="lazy"></li>
  </ul>
</div>
<section class="mc-jobs" aria-labelledby="mc-jobs-h">
  <div class="mc-jobs__in">
    <p class="mc-jobs__eye">Not everybody is a 25-year-old PT.</p>
    <h2 class="mc-jobs__h" id="mc-jobs-h">Your life won’t fit a perfect routine.<br class="mc-jobs__br"> Your body still needs one.</h2>
    <p class="mc-jobs__sub">You can’t always sleep, train and eat perfectly. MUTO gives your body a daily foundation anyway, so you can keep showing up for work, training and the people who rely on you, now and for years to come.</p>
    <ul class="mc-jobs__grid" role="list">
      <li class="mc-jobs__card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="11.5"/><path d="M16 9v7l5 3"/></svg>
        <h3>Afternoons that hold</h3>
        <p>Flat by 3pm? Vitamins B6, B12 and folate help reduce tiredness and fatigue.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="mc-jobs__card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M25.5 12.5A10 10 0 0 0 7 11"/><path d="M6.5 19.5A10 10 0 0 0 25 21"/><path d="M7 5.5V11h5.5"/><path d="M25 26.5V21h-5.5"/></svg>
        <h3>Ready to go again</h3>
        <p>For the sessions you care about. Vitamin D supports normal muscle function.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="mc-jobs__card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4.5" y="10.5" width="23" height="15" rx="2.5"/><path d="M12 10.5V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2.5"/><path d="M4.5 17h23"/></svg>
        <h3>Made for a full life</h3>
        <p>Travel, deadlines, small kids. Two capsules with breakfast. Nothing to mix, nothing to carry.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="mc-jobs__card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="4.5" width="14" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="M10 8.5h12v17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-8a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M10 15h12"/></svg>
        <h3>One jar, not ten</h3>
        <p>19 nutrients, every dose on the label. Fewer pots, less guesswork.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  /* The reviews strip just above this band: same off-white as the buy box (#FAFAFA), not white */
  html body #MainContent > .shopify-section[id$="__reviews_ticker"],html body #MainContent > .shopify-section[id$="__reviews_ticker"] .mtk{background:#fafafa!important}
  /* "As seen in": the press logos from the listicle, under the reviews strip */
  .mc-seen{background:#fafafa;padding:22px 20px 26px;text-align:center}
  .mc-seen__lab{margin:0;font-family:var(--mc-mono,"Sometype Mono"),ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(36,34,35,.62)}
  .mc-seen__logos{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:0 48px;margin:14px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .mc-seen__logos li{margin:0;padding:0;line-height:0}
  .mc-seen__logos li::before{content:none!important}
  .mc-seen__logos img{display:block;width:auto;height:30px;max-width:180px;object-fit:contain;mix-blend-mode:multiply;filter:grayscale(1);opacity:.78}
  @media (max-width:749px){.mc-seen{padding:18px 16px 22px}.mc-seen__logos{gap:0 28px}.mc-seen__logos img{height:22px}}
  .mc-jobs{background:#242223;color:#fff;font-family:var(--mc-font,"Neue Haas Grotesk Display Pro"),sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  .mc-jobs__in{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:88px 40px 96px}
  .mc-jobs__eye{margin:0 0 18px;font-family:var(--mc-mono,"Sometype Mono"),ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5efaff}
  .mc-jobs__h{margin:0;max-width:24ch;font-family:inherit;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,56px);text-wrap:balance;font-weight:500;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff}
  .mc-jobs__sub{margin:22px 0 0;max-width:58ch;font-size:clamp(16px,1.35vw,19px);line-height:1.5;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);text-wrap:pretty}
  .mc-jobs__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:48px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .mc-jobs__card{margin:0;padding:28px 24px 26px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05)}
  .mc-jobs__card::before{content:none!important}
  .mc-jobs__card svg{display:block;width:32px;height:32px;color:#5efaff}
  .mc-jobs__card h3{margin:22px 0 0;font-family:inherit;font-size:20px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.005em;text-transform:none;color:#fff}
  .mc-jobs__card p{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.5;color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);text-wrap:pretty}
  @media (max-width:989px){.mc-jobs__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
  @media (max-width:749px){
    .mc-jobs__in{padding:56px 20px 60px}
    .mc-jobs__eye{margin-bottom:14px;font-size:11px}
    .mc-jobs__h{font-size:32px}
    .mc-jobs__br{display:none}
    .mc-jobs__sub{margin-top:16px;font-size:16px}
    .mc-jobs__grid{gap:10px;margin-top:32px}
    .mc-jobs__card{padding:18px 16px 18px}
    .mc-jobs__card svg{width:26px;height:26px}
    .mc-jobs__card h3{margin-top:14px;font-size:17px}
    .mc-jobs__card p{font-size:14px}
  }
  /* Phones: the "Why it happens" stat cards below match this band's cards (compact, left-aligned, same padding,
     radius and type sizes), and both headings are the same size */
  @media (max-width:749px){
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc .mc__prb{padding-top:56px!important;padding-bottom:56px!important}
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc .mc__prb-pill{margin:0 0 14px!important;font-size:11px!important;letter-spacing:.14em!important}
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc h2.mc__h2,html:root body .mc-jobs .mc-jobs__h{font-size:30px!important;line-height:1!important}
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc .mc__prb-list{gap:10px!important;margin-top:32px!important}
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc .mc__prb-item{display:block!important;min-height:0!important;height:auto!important;padding:18px 16px!important;border-radius:12px!important;text-align:left!important}
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc .mc__prb-item .mc__std-meta{display:flex!important;justify-content:flex-start!important;margin:0!important}
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc .mc__prb-item .mc__trust-tag{font-size:10px!important;padding:5px 9px!important}
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc .mc__prb-fig{margin:14px 0 0!important;font-size:40px!important;line-height:1!important;text-align:left!important}
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc .mc__prb-text{margin:12px 0 0!important;max-width:none!important;text-align:left!important}
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc .prb-why{margin:0!important;font-size:17px!important;line-height:1.2!important;text-align:left!important}
    html:root body #MainContent#MainContent [id$="__problem"] .mc .prb-how{max-width:none!important;margin:6px 0 0!important;font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.5!important;text-align:left!important}
  }
</style>
